WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:08.018
The sprite's wand shines.

2
00:00:08.019 --> 00:00:14.068
"Who are you?" Pip asks.

3
00:00:14.069 --> 00:00:20.266
"My name is June," the sprite says.

4
00:00:20.267 --> 00:00:24.379
"I come from Sweet Land."

5
00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:28.156
"Wow!" Pip grins.

6
00:00:28.157 --> 00:00:33.971
But Jane does not. "Is this a joke?"

7
00:00:33.972 --> 00:00:37.529
"Sweet Land is just a game."

8
00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:44.559
Pip taps Jane. "That's not nice."

9
00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:50.921
"No, it's not a joke," June says.

10
00:00:50.922 --> 00:00:54.451
"Sweet Land is my home."

11
00:00:54.452 --> 00:00:58.209
"What do you want?" Jane asks.

12
00:00:58.210 --> 00:01:02.897
"Jane, that's rude!" Pip says.

13
00:01:02.898 --> 00:01:06.401
June takes out a note.

14
00:01:06.402 --> 00:01:10.050
"This is for you," she says.

15
00:01:10.051 --> 00:01:25.449
"It's from the queen."

16
00:01:25.450 --> 00:01:33.681
June waves her wand. Zap!

17
00:01:33.682 --> 00:01:38.793
The note gets big.

18
00:01:38.794 --> 00:01:44.947
The kids look at it.

19
00:01:44.948 --> 00:01:48.457
To Jane and Pip,

20
00:01:48.458 --> 00:01:52.025
The Duke of Yuck has a bad plan.

21
00:01:52.026 --> 00:01:55.395
He wants to take over Sweet Land.

22
00:01:55.396 --> 00:01:57.366
You must help us.

23
00:01:57.367 --> 00:02:04.589
From Queen Sweet

24
00:02:04.590 --> 00:02:11.009
Pip hops up and down. "How fun!"

25
00:02:11.010 --> 00:02:14.277
"This is fake," Jane says.

26
00:02:14.278 --> 00:02:19.872
June huffs. "It's not fake.

27
00:02:19.873 --> 00:02:24.320
You are the prince and the princess!

28
00:02:24.321 --> 00:02:29.307
You must help the queen!"

